Here's how to create a simple Lumen API for searching files in a server data directory based on the provided OpenAPI schema. Below are the necessary files and their content.

### 1. `bootstrap/app.php`
This file is used to bootstrap the Lumen application.

<FILEPATH>
bootstrap/app.php
</FILEPATH>
<CODE>
<?php

require_once __DIR__.'/../vendor/autoload.php';

$app = new Laravel\Lumen\Application(
    $_ENV['APP_BASE_PATH'] ?? dirname(__DIR__)
);

// Load environment variables
$app->configure('app');

// Register the routes
